Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,TOHO
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.96,0:00:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Today's so lively!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.63,0:00:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,They have left the burnt fireworks just like this! How terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.84,0:00:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch the ball, Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.37,0:00:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! Where?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.04,0:00:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Look above your head!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.21,0:00:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We've won!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.95,0:00:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, why didn't you catch the ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.02,0:00:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch! Where is GIant?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.19,0:00:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Look above!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.49,0:00:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheer up, Nobita-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.16,0:00:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.18,0:00:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.57,0:00:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I remember!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.01,0:01:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that's my teddy bear!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.68,0:01:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.49,0:01:19.39,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,000)\c&H4471B1&\pos(474.667,262)}Memo{\c&H3C2B84&}ries
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.49,0:01:19.39,Title,,0,0,0,,{\c&H323624&\pos(1136,582)}of
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.49,0:01:19.33,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,000)\c&H5B9159&\pos(1616,746)}Grandma
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.86,0:01:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.70,0:01:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.83,0:01:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome home!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.20,0:01:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Mum, why did you throw away my little teddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.07,0:01:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,"My little teddy" he says...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.40,0:01:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Why now? You ignored it all this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.47,0:01:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You should just discard it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.24,0:01:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.15,0:01:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,My little teddy is no trash!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.78,0:01:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up with him today?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.36,0:01:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.90,0:02:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the bandage, Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.17,0:02:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.04,0:02:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.18,0:02:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That stuffed teddy means so much to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.62,0:02:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.52,0:02:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I finished bandaging my teddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.42,0:02:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall I heal it with the Time Cloth?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.73,0:02:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.89,0:02:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's all dirty and worn out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.93,0:02:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.33,0:02:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.96,0:02:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But look at all those patches.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.96,0:02:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, my grandma always fixed the teddy for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.96,0:02:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a grandma?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.40,0:02:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,She passed away when I was in the kindergarten, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.01,0:02:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I remember!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.81,0:02:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I have her photos.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.09,0:02:55.62,Title,,0,0,0,,{\c&H8C7148&\frz337\org(1291,-158)\pos(1322.667,461)}Nobita-{\c&H4297B1&}chan's {\c&H141B8D&}Memories
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.39,0:02:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This is her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.99,0:03:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,She's holding you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.83,0:03:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,She looks kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.03,0:03:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, she is. She loved me a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.19,0:03:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,She always enveloped me with love, warmth and stood by me always.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.33,0:03:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd love to see her alive once again!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.04,0:03:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I can have my little teddy fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.67,0:03:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.81,0:03:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We can just use the Time Machine to see her alive once again!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.51,0:03:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! That's not a good idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.15,0:03:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.65,0:04:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,When she sees you all grown up, what's she going to think?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.06,0:04:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,She'd probably flipped over in shock!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.83,0:04:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh... We can just explain the situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.33,0:04:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You think she'll understand the Time Machine?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.90,0:04:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But... Still...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.27,0:04:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Memories are meant to be buried in the depths of one's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.64,0:04:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's just have a peek at her!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.31,0:04:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hide somewhere and have a peek at her!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.04,0:04:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It should be fine as long as we don't meet or reach out to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.51,0:04:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You promise to?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.38,0:04:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, just a peek, promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.95,0:04:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.25,0:04:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay! Let's board!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.25,0:04:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hop in!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.76,0:04:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.86,0:04:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita!!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.50,0:04:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder where did he went....
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.00,0:04:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,He left it damaged! For god's sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.91,0:04:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go back to the time when I was 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.28,0:04:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.35,0:05:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.89,0:05:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.72,0:05:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our playbase!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.56,0:05:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.59,0:05:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But why didn't we jump in to our house?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.53,0:05:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,If anyone sees us, there'd be panic!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.86,0:05:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.33,0:05:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.57,0:05:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It looked so spacious!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.24,0:05:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's because you were still very tiny...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.24,0:05:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.04,0:05:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's shift to the gardens.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.48,0:05:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, this place hasn't changed a bit! \NThis is our garden!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.65,0:05:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.76,0:05:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the sandbox!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.36,0:05:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone will find us! Let's quickly take a peek of grandma.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.98,0:05:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's enter from the backdoor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.41,0:06:03.11,GadgetCard,,0,0,0,,{\c&H4EB3C4&\pos(917.215,1053)}Pass-Through Hoop!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.35,0:06:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.78,0:06:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.66,0:06:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That tea plate!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.26,0:06:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough, we're going back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.26,0:06:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.90,0:06:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandma always stayed in that room!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.63,0:06:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, we're just going to take a peek at her!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.11,0:06:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, she's not here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.58,0:06:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.18,0:06:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe she's watching TV!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.48,0:06:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Quietly!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.49,0:06:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not here neither!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.69,0:06:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,She must be in the living room then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.52,0:06:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Not here neither!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.43,0:06:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe she's upstairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.60,0:07:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The door won't open! This door was always like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.51,0:07:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If pulling doens't work, push it! Heave ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.98,0:07:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you kids and what are you doing in our house?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.48,0:07:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my! You're so young!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.92,0:07:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.09,0:07:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But your face will be covered with wrinkles very soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.76,0:07:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my, I'll be like a white Manjuu and....
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.63,0:07:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you two, sneaking into peoples' homes?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.57,0:07:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe she didn't recognize us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.67,0:07:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.14,0:07:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's look for grandma, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.32,0:07:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.62,0:07:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's me, at age 3...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.86,0:07:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.26,0:07:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing like you are now...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.13,0:08:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Giant and Suneo! I'll make you two pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.80,0:08:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.54,0:08:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you bully me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.71,0:08:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They're just kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.78,0:08:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But at today's baseball match, they....
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.48,0:08:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mix up the past and the present!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.85,0:08:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.52,0:08:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,How cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.52,0:08:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,How and what part of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.39,0:08:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You alirght, Nobi-{\i1}chan{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.63,0:08:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.16,0:08:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't cry. I'll walk you to your house.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.64,0:08:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh you, your face is all red!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.07,0:08:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Nevermind, let's see Grandma!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.07,0:08:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,She wasn't at our home road.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.78,0:08:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,She's probably at the bookstore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.45,0:09:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go to the bookstore and see if she's there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.05,0:09:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Grandma!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.78,0:09:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,She's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.42,0:09:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,So nostalgic!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.13,0:09:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome home, grandma!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.79,0:09:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.90,0:09:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you get dumplings for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.34,0:09:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but your favorite dumplings sold out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.11,0:09:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,In place, I've brought your favorite Ohagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.51,0:10:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't wanna! I want dumplings!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.05,0:10:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.39,0:10:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,i hate you grandma! Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.32,0:10:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandma, get lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.93,0:10:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.03,0:10:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you! Don't yell at grandma!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.14,0:10:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you pick on my Nobita?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.61,0:10:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I can explain the very deep meaning behind my actions, actually I'm Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.24,0:10:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But Nobita is my boy here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.48,0:10:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I'm Nobita from the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.48,0:10:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I time traveled via the Time Machine...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.58,0:10:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This boy must be mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.59,0:10:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Mum!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.15,0:10:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.65,0:10:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Mum!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.00,0:10:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandma, when I grow up, I will open a toy shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.13,0:10:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.80,0:11:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna play with my toys and teddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.11,0:11:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.97,0:11:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want me to become, grandma?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.71,0:11:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.69,0:11:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate you, grandma!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.69,0:11:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.24,0:11:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go home, Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.84,0:11:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But I was very mean to my grandma.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.65,0:11:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just a preschooler, so that doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.35,0:11:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I love my grandma.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.16,0:11:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now listen, you're in the past to see your grandma
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.69,0:12:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you were selfish... your grandma loves you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.24,0:12:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your grandma!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.18,0:12:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That teddy bear!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.23,0:12:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They went to the toy shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.80,0:12:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,She's buying you a new toy. Now let's head back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.14,0:12:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But they didn't buy anything, it seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.51,0:12:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Nevermind that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.46,0:13:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,They didn't buy any toy here neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.09,0:13:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't they just gazing at the toys?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.43,0:13:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No, they must be looking for something!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.10,0:13:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And what might that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.37,0:13:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't remember clearly, but I have remember something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.39,0:13:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,They didn't find what they were looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.53,0:13:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,They're still at it. She might faint!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.94,0:13:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if she can go on....
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.31,0:13:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,There, you must be tired!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.67,0:14:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He's asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.91,0:14:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what they were looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.14,0:14:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You're awake, now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.31,0:14:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandma, did you buy me fireworks?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.51,0:14:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Fireworks!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.88,0:14:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, grandma!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.69,0:14:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Nobi-{\i1}chan{\i0}. But they only sell fireworks in the summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.29,0:14:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We searched all over and didn't find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.26,0:14:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,NO!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.77,0:14:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Fireworks!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.71,0:14:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away, grandma!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.11,0:14:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.94,0:15:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate you, grandma!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.98,0:15:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no! She's coming this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.57,0:15:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,She almost found us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.47,0:15:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fall and he wants fireworks...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.25,0:15:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm very selfish!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.32,0:15:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't come any closer! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.96,0:15:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Nobi-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.84,0:15:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.22,0:16:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.56,0:16:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nice to see you all here...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.77,0:16:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Gimme back my teddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.28,0:16:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.87,0:17:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon, what happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.87,0:17:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm stuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.61,0:17:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the boy from then, and that's Nobita's precious teddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.75,0:17:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Gimme that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.69,0:17:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I can explain the circumstances!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.93,0:17:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!\N-Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.17,0:17:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Gimme Nobita's teddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.13,0:17:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Gimme that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.01,0:17:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant! Suneo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.58,0:17:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, please forgive us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.75,0:17:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Got off!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.82,0:17:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.26,0:17:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.26,0:17:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.59,0:18:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We won! Let's give back the teddy to Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.97,0:18:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You can only deliberately lose so many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.34,0:18:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder where grandma is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.68,0:18:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}, we saw her, isn't that enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.08,0:18:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.34,0:18:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna see grandma just one more time, please?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.28,0:19:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.60,0:19:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Mum, I must pee!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.54,0:19:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Mum, it's the weirdo from the earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.91,0:19:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Mum!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.65,0:19:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.75,0:19:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.05,0:19:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother-in-law, did any strange boy come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.59,0:19:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.69,0:19:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. Maybe I should file a complaint with the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.74,0:19:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for hiding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.58,0:19:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you leaving already?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.45,0:20:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't suspect me, grandma?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.85,0:20:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.49,0:20:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.12,0:20:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Boy, you brought back this teddy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.13,0:20:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.03,0:20:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks really.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.17,0:20:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Now for the stitching...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.44,0:20:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll use this cloth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.13,0:20:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.47,0:20:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.72,0:21:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandma, do you find your Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}, adorable?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.19,0:21:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, of course I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.63,0:21:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to stand by him always and take a good care of him, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.27,0:21:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.27,0:21:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm already aged, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.31,0:21:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't say such sad things...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.52,0:21:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Wish I could be alive till when he's a first grader.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.90,0:22:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd love to see him wearing his uniform and his randsel bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.25,0:22:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.13,0:22:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's my schoolbag.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.70,0:22:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.63,0:22:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.13,0:22:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Doraemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.13,0:22:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But only this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.81,0:22:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandma.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.35,0:23:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandma, while it may be hard to believe me, but I'm actually Nobita.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.13,0:23:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, the 4th-grader.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.40,0:23:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So you really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.94,0:23:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it must be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.08,0:23:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really believe me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.41,0:23:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Who'd suspect you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.52,0:23:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandma!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.02,0:23:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I missed you so much, grandma!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.46,0:23:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.23,0:23:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for being very selfish, grandma.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.77,0:23:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who's at fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.87,0:23:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to see you happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.68,0:23:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But I couldn't make you happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.51,0:23:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why you tell me to go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.85,0:24:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm very happy to see your smiling face.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.29,0:24:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I'm your grandmother.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.50,0:24:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,"I'm glad I'm your grandmother"
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.60,0:24:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandma!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.81,0:24:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Nobi-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.21,0:24:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandma!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.02,0:24:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want me to be when I grow up?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.32,0:24:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I already saw you all grown-up, so....
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.06,0:24:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What did I become? Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.67,0:24:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,My grandson.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.31,0:24:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? The ears are fully stitched.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.74,0:24:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The arms too!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.14,0:24:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,True!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.21,0:25:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But who could've?...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.28,0:25:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's bath-time!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.01,0:25:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Mum did it...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.22,0:25:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Mum!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.92,0:25:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for stitching my little teddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.79,0:25:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You're very welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.49,0:25:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you wearing your school bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.56,0:25:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.90,0:25:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.75,0:25:31.84,ED,,0,0,0,,The important thing is simply maintaining your silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.34,0:25:38.89,ED,,0,0,0,,That was over 100 years ago\NBut even if I put it into words, I'm sure that's all there is to it
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.80,0:25:41.97,ED,,0,0,0,,I really don't have anything
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.64,0:25:46.77,ED,,0,0,0,,If you say you love me, give me a hug
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.06,0:25:51.57,ED,,0,0,0,,I feel good, so please hug me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.19,0:25:56.86,ED,,0,0,0,,Because I'm always lonely
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.45,0:26:07.08,ED,,0,0,0,,I want to feel the warmth together
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.04,0:26:11.96,ED,,0,0,0,,Don't be embarrassed, be brave
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.84,0:26:17.59,ED,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's all hug together
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.88,0:26:23.39,ED,,0,0,0,,I'm not alone, I'm not scared
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.89,0:26:27.27,ED,,0,0,0,,I'LL GIVE YOU A HUG to you too

Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.60,0:26:27.89,ED,,0,0,0,,Let's hug!
